{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1469838-trinity-continuum-doyen-theory","id":1469838,"title":"[Trinity Continuum] Doyen Theory","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-07T08:20:28-08:00","id":1469838,"title":"[Trinity Continuum] Doyen Theory","content":"I'm preparing multi-era <b>Continuum</b> game - probably <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1468693-tc-assasins-instead-aberrant-on-timeline\">everything beside <b>Aberrant</b></a>. I do not, yet versed in <b>Aeon</b>, but from Secrets chapters of other books I know that there are some settings <b>Continuum</b> spoilers. You are reading it on your own responsibility...<br /> <br /> So if I get it right...<br /> <br /> For everything 'weird 'on Earth, across <b>Continuum</b> eras, are Quantum Energies and super aliens called <i><b>Doyen</b></i>.<br /> <br /> In 1800s Earth got some 'influx' of Quantum energies, so weird things start to be contained in it. Till the end of 1930s, this influx lead to <b>Aether </b>( probably ) and surely <b>Adventure!</b> eras.<br /> <br /> In 1940s, with World War 2, came Doyen, locking Solar System in special antiQuantum sphere. With that weirdness was lowered, and new space programs of USA and USSR did not found great Quantum balls hanged in space.<br /> <br /> In <b>Aberrant </b>era, this 'Quantum Barrier' was broken by Davis Mal and his followers - so it lead to Quantum Transcendency and conquer of cosmos by Novas / Aberrants.<br /> <br /> In <b>Aeon</b> era, new Psions created by humanity are going for Doyen, to let humanity reclaim the cosmos.<br /> <br /> I get it right? If not - where I did not understand <b>Trinity</b> lore?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-07-2021, 11:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-07T09:01:40-08:00","id":1469843,"title":"","content":"Not totally right.<br /> <br /> Doyens start observing Earth sometime before Adventure! Era (possibly related to Aether).<br /> <br /> In 1922 there is the Hammersmith event that started officially Adventure! Era, the observing Doyens raise a barrier that made it hard to handle Quantum and Psi inside and limited \u201cteluric events\u201d to a local level, preventing things like Hammersmith from happening and affecting the entire planet and more. The barrier has this side effect that increase the general \u201cweirdness level\u201d, making Flux Manipulation (Talent stuff) easier.<br /> <br /> In 2018, after more than a few trying, Divis Mal cause a Quantum event big enough to break the Barrier, and at same level increase the \u201cbackground Quantum level\u201d to a level that cause people to start erupting all around the world. As a side effect, it keeps Doyens away for a while, and Earth capable of defending from flying meteors and other weapons of the Doyens.<br /> <br /> Mal pumps a bit more Quantum during his time on Earth, keeping the Quantum level high enoug for a few more years until Ultimatum, when Novas leave Earth. The Quantum level slowly goes down, but the war left many Quantum flux zones, places that had their \u201cquantum stability\u201d broken to the point it causes mutations and general death to all inside.<br /> <br /> In 2104 Sarah Bhurano cause a new event, now using the knowledge she gathered over the last 200 years, reducing the general Quantum level, reducing quantum flux zones and creating a bunch of Psiads and latents (people capable of gather psi, but not use it). As a side effect, it unlocks Quantakinesis to all human Psiads.<br /> <br /> Doyens that where around noticed this event and has the idea of using humans to hunt the Aberrants that are all around with their lethal Quantum powers, and pick some humans and boost their psi use to create the first Psions, the Proxies, one of them Bhurano, that becomes the first Quantakinetic. They also give the humans the Prometheus chambers, to create Psions from the latents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 12-07-2021, 02:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-07T09:17:58-08:00","id":1469845,"title":"","content":"Additionally, we know a bit more about Doyens<br /> <br /> They were a biological Psi user species once, that were so paranoid that they tried to ascend to real immortality in a forced way, becoming locked in a \u201cmid term\u201d, a psi powered bobble of plasma. They start hunting Quantum user races, as they can kill doyens by using their powers, while psi is not effective in it (except for Quantakinesis, but it\u2019s a human thing).<br /> <br /> We also know they are not very United, and there are a limited number of them, as they can\u2019t reproduce anymore, and previous attempts created monstrous offsprings (to their eyes). They work in groups and there are some of them that are absolutely powerful, but they are individually limited, so they need to help each other, even the most powerful among them, to properly kill races and destroy planets. So they use other races to their long term plans, evolving them to a level they can still control, but limiting their further evolution, like they did to the Qin and Chromatics.<br /> <br /> When the Quantakinetic powers start to be understood by the doyen, they got afraid and decided to kill all humans, not only the Aberrants (to be fair there were Doyens working in that for a while, and the Doyen Bering int he use of humans to kill humans just changed their mind).<br /> <br /> Eventually they would launch a war effort to kill humans, but that is not part of the timeline yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 12-08-2021, 09:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-07T13:02:01-08:00","id":1469863,"title":"","content":"So basically the Doyen are still &quot;{*insert preferred word*}&quot; who are paranoid and arrogant who are the reason why there are loads of dead civilisations in the galaxy. I'm curious if it's me tion wether there are any other quantum using races that have or currently exist. In 1E humans were the first race to evolve quantum powers and when the Doyen discovered this they basically collectively s**t themselves before deciding to basically genocide humanity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26058-aeonstorm","name":"Aeonstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-07T13:27:33-08:00","id":1469866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aeonstorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1469838-trinity-continuum-doyen-theory?p=1469863#post1469863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--